        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>INOX FH23PD8450, Square Urban Keyed Entry Door Passage Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Urban Flush Pull Keyed Entry Set is operated by a key on the outside and a thumbturn works the lock from the inside. It is available in several high-quality finishes; and whichever finish you choose, determines whether this pocket door flush pull set is made out of stainless steel or brass. This small profile 23/8 inch Urban Square Keyed Entry Mortise Pocket Door Hardware is a great way to add an unobtrusive keyed lock to your sliding pocket doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Pocket Door Keyed Lock:</b> Use when a lock is needed. Unlocked by a key from the outside and a thumbturn on the inside. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/urban-flush-pull-passage-set-inox-fh23pd8010\"><b>Passage Set</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/urban-flush-pull-privacy-set-inox-fh23pd8440\"><b>Privacy Set</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Urban Sliding Door Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass or Stainless</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Length: 2-3/8\" square</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Projection: 5/64\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Height: 5-29/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Width: 11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Depth: 3-41/64\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Height: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: 1”</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\", 2\", 2-1/4\", 2-3/4\", or 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Backset: 2-3/4\", 2-1/2\", or 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Schlage C keyway 5 pin mortise cylinder.</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Finger Pull: is thrown by pressing the button on the mortise's face plate. It can be retracted simply by pressing it flush with the faceplate.</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/INX-FH23PD8450-specifications.pdf?v=1718159612\"><b>INOX FH23PD8450 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Set:</b> two (2) flush pulls, a keyed entry mortise, and all mounting hardware. <b>For One (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>",
